      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Starlink is making a 14-year Delta loyalist rethink his airline.\n\nAllFly cofounder Kenny Totten, who has held Delta Diamond status for seven years, tried @Starlink on United.\n\nHe downloaded and uploaded video, worked with teammates and built an app during the flight.\n\n“It was amazing, like being on the internet at my house, in my living room.”\n\nNow he’s considering flying United more.\n\nThat’s how good Starlink is. One flight can make someone reconsider years of airline loyalty.",
